    "text": "12 hours ago RANCHO MURIETA, CA (MPG) - Concerns about a growing homeless encampment near Rancho Murieta surfaced during Sacramento County Supervisor Rosario Rodriguez’s first community meeting in Rancho Murieta on May 4, after Rodriguez discussed a new county ordinance allowing authorities to clear illegal camping on both public and private property. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
